 ## Search
 
-Search returns 50 results per page.
+Search returns 100 results per page (`PAGE_SIZE` in `app/config.py`).
 
 ## Address lookups
 
 Address lookups go to the Mapline geocoding API.
-Mapline's free tier allows 100 requests a minute per API key.
-A lookup gives up after 5 seconds.
+The portal is configured to send up to 250 lookups a minute (`GEOCODE_REQUESTS_PER_MINUTE`).
+A lookup gives up after 10 seconds (`GEOCODE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`).
+
+Mapline's own rate limits are not defined in this repository. This page
+previously said the free tier allows 100 requests a minute per API key; that
+figure is unverified here and is lower than the configured 250, so check it
+against Mapline's current terms.
 
 ## Account export
 
-The account export runs nightly at 02:00 UTC.
-Deleted accounts are left out of the export, as section 4 of the privacy policy requires.
+The account export runs nightly at 02:00 UTC (`EXPORT_HOUR_UTC`).
+
+Requirement: deleted accounts must be left out of the export, as section 4 of
+the privacy policy requires.
+
+Current behaviour does not meet this requirement. `export_accounts` in
+`app/export.py` writes every account it is given, including a `deleted` column,
+and does not filter deleted accounts out. Unless deleted accounts are removed
+before they reach it, they appear in the export.
